{\b Argus desktop daemon}\par
\par
Copyright (c) 2026 PierreGode. All rights reserved.\par
\par
Argus is a small background utility that reads your local Claude Code credentials, polls Anthropic for usage / rate-limit information and GitHub for issue and pull-request counts, and sends that data to your Argus hardware device over Bluetooth LE or USB.\par
